urname>Ann-Charlotte</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Elisabeth</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Stefan</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Determination of Triton X-100 in plasma-derived coagulation factor VIII and factor IX products by reversed-phase high-performance liquid chromatography</article-title><source>Journal of Chromatography A</source><year>2002</year><volume>946</volume><fpage>163</fpage><lpage>168</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11873965</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ales</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Peter</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Horst</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Raimund</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Djuro</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Extraction of Triton X-100 and its determination in virus-inactivated human plasma by the solvent-detergent method</article-title><source>Journal of Chromatography A</source><year>1994</year><volume>658</volume><fpage>475</fpage><lpage>481</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8118553</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0021-9673(94)80038-3</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Denis</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Paolo</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Gabriella</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Carlo</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of eluent composition and pH and chemiluminescent reagent pH on ion chromatographic selectivity and luminol-based chemiluminescence detection of Co<sup>2+</sup>, Mn<sup>2+ </sup>and Fe<sup>2+ </sup>at trace levels</article-title><source>Talanta</source><year>2007</year><volume>72</volume><fpage>249</fpage><lpage>255</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19071610</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.talanta.2006.10.026</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Baoxin</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Dongmei</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Jiagen</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhujun</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Flow-injection chemiluminescence simultaneous determination of cobalt(II) and copper(II) using partial least squares calibration</article-title><source>Talanta</source><year>2006</year><volume>69</volume><fpage>160</fpage><lpage>165</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18970548</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.talanta.2005.09.017</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>White</surname><given-names>EH</given-names></name><name><surname>Bursey</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Chemiluminescence of luminol and related hydrazides: the light emission step</article-title><source>J Am Chem Soc</source><year>1964</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>940</fpage><lpage>942</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1021/ja01059a050</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zhujun</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Jiuru</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Xinrong</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Luminol chemiluminescence reaction in analytical chemistry</article-title><source>Chin Chemical Reagents</source><year>1987</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>149</fpage><lpage>156</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>